{"title":"1986 IMO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all (if any) functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> taking the non-negative reals onto the non-negative reals, such that\n</p><p>(a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/8/278e0d1e71ef00dc6e2757a16e98f6b8fa5417d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(xf(y))f(y) = f(x+y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"194\" height=\"18\" /> for all non-negative <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />;\n</p><p>(b) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/5/985e68c437ac5c287c6d9d07d0a15311f2f04e27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />;\n</p><p>(c) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/2/ed231361130473e2376e746cb6d6bdc881c903f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" /> for every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/d/3fd8203e454909f1e1055b416b166517d9ece1cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\leq x &lt; 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/9/4a962e155cdd9627968c59e4844840ec5252a301.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y\\ge2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />, there exists a nonnegative real <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/7/2375e4df550054ed6885a16802093a74a6586044.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t+2=x+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/9/4791c51c182fe3930d8b6b89b2e56e6da2428cd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x+y)=f(t+2)=f(tf(2))f(2)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"311\" height=\"18\" />. Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/c/a8c9cbf3e3c04dc46dea71f60acd0cb704eabc4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/5/4b5b510d2d240faf57158e06d6f109bf4ae43a75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/2/3123986e9c31a9b7f740325866cfdeb186219ad7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, take <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/b/7ebcffe6d28ea0d18f249a2a1dc63e14fa0331dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0=f(2)=f((2-x)+(x))=f((2-x)f(x))f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"393\" height=\"18\" />.\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/d/3fd486fff30f608e9ac917120874d42e4608e4df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)\\neq0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/2/3123986e9c31a9b7f740325866cfdeb186219ad7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/6/37602e024d0c50993aa6282b6e92f1774d84ca62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f((2-x)f(x))=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" />.\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/c/3ec96ae6ab218dc5313f508ab7be036ae93271ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2-x)f(x)\\ge2\\Leftrightarrow f(x)\\ge\\frac{2}{2-x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"256\" height=\"37\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/2/3123986e9c31a9b7f740325866cfdeb186219ad7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/4/7e4db59625b8e311983006cbab1f2ac15e7f4295.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a)&gt;\\frac{2}{2-a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"102\" height=\"37\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/b/bbb1f94ca3e1aa876fd605ccb4cfeecf1dcc2f90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a)=\\frac{2}{2-a-\\epsilon}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"132\" height=\"37\" /> for some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/4/ca47de052eb3fb5454694d9bce3561ebff831a1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\epsilon&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/2/2024fd8ac46c5811e9016f6a8b8007e34b747b4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le a&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />.\nThen <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/b/7bb3e3ac50054d60c0252396eeafa28434f85f0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left((2-a-\\epsilon)f(a)\\right)f(a)=f(2-\\epsilon)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"271\" height=\"18\" />. The left hand side is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f695b3d8b308699f99b6f01ac8cb4eb0ef6b430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left((2-a-\\epsilon)\\left(\\frac{2}{2-a-\\epsilon}\\right)\\right)f(a)=f(2)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"357\" height=\"43\" />, but the right hand side is nonzero, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/9/e093c5aa12bd51d60a7a7cbfcbed689c825030a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2-\\epsilon&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/d/3fd486fff30f608e9ac917120874d42e4608e4df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)\\neq0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/2/3123986e9c31a9b7f740325866cfdeb186219ad7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/0/7f037245a7bfdbffa518093763c105e74b86b0c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=\\frac{2}{2-x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"103\" height=\"37\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/2/2024fd8ac46c5811e9016f6a8b8007e34b747b4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le a&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />.\nFor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/3/5d30154149d574ed2dc72923b37a100db76e230c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />,\\begin{eqnarray*}f(xf(y))f(y) &amp;=&amp; f\\left((x)\\left(\\frac{2}{2-y}\\right)\\right)\\left(\\frac{2}{2-y}\\right)\\\\ &amp;=&amp;\\left(\\frac{2}{2-\\frac{2x}{2-y}}\\right)\\left(\\frac{2}{2-y}\\right)\\\\ &amp;=&amp;\\frac{4}{4-2y-2x}\\\\ &amp;=&amp;\\frac{2}{2-y-x}\\\\ f(x+y)&amp;=&amp;\\frac{2}{2-y-x}.\\end{eqnarray*}\nIndeed, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/8/b3886b93172f93f2af16dcc44428e6d7efa63b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(xf(y))f(y)=f(x+y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"194\" height=\"18\" />, so the desired function is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f5b124dcb4320443683ab5366ff940c04c122b7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x)=\\begin{cases}\\frac{2}{2-x},&amp; 0\\le x&lt;2\\\\0,&amp; x\\ge2.\\end{cases}\\]\" width=\"200\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>This solution was posted and copyrighted by Shen Kislay Kai. The original thread for this problem can be found here: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://aops.com/community/p397033\">[1]</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Taking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/a/40ac4b6f5ab516ac6fe7132ed2fe7a1d77ca02dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/f/e3f8d0ff72df14f9650d5428e7c7e6c1ba5c684e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x+2)=0 \\forall x\\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"153\" height=\"18\" />, or equivalently <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/2/4f27d8b01c51e3ba99f2094d792c2153399f3754.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=0  \\forall x\\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" />. Taking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f3fc09b69799102fcb1267876d7ef36d209431d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/2/e1280959c36db9e659089d9d5a545e0a0baf61a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le x&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> yields<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/1/1c1e8571ae7a6e47e27ab24aaac54e3e0a4f5bfb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(xf(2-x))f(2-x)=f(2)=0\\]\" width=\"259\" height=\"18\" />Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/4/844a70ed9dba89fc06d34e58714002d99e89ae36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;2-x\\le 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"110\" height=\"16\" />, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c92ebafd13c2cd30c008262d47bb3a7f3e0d1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(xf(2-x))=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" />, which forces<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/2/d4215e571d78a0dfc3f722e0d0b156d8f620e2c4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[xf(2-x)\\ge 2\\implies f(x)\\ge \\frac{2}{2-x}\\forall 0\\le x&lt;2.\\]\" width=\"355\" height=\"37\" />Now taking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/c/70c0c0758f9f38c4b3ca74264246cffb11bfe194.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2/f(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02e952f426b797daabeb48698dede4782770bbe5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le y&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> gives,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfb20297eef023baf0205bdf280ed865eb94568c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(y+2/f(y))=f(2)f(y)=0\\implies y+2/f(y)\\ge 2.\\]\" width=\"406\" height=\"18\" />Thus,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3e9de042e3f485e7aba681b6a5a9ee804843668.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(y)\\le \\frac{2}{2-y}\\forall 0\\le y&lt;2\\]\" width=\"189\" height=\"40\" />Hence, this forces <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/f/a7f264268ac487e5cf479f5b25aa2065083bdd41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=2/(2-x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/2/e1280959c36db9e659089d9d5a545e0a0baf61a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le x&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />, giving a final answer of<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/9/0b96633c6733fb81f967c135c5fad0bc79100d65.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x)=\\begin{cases} 0 &amp; \\text{ if }x \\ge 2 \\\\ \\frac{2}{2-x} &amp; \\text{ if } 0 \\le x &lt; 2 . \\end{cases}\\]\" width=\"220\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>This solution was posted and copyrighted by winnertakeover. The original thread for this problem can be found here: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://aops.com/community/p11534549\">[2]</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/e/6de7dc5f91f89a43911ae74626aa37d75d53ee9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"18\" /> be the assertion. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/5/cc50021aacb2c13132778e74effcaa917332a7ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x,2)\\implies f(x+2)=0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"209\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is defined for non-negative reals, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/6/e06538baa1eea7f8612e8fb7a75dc0399fa56595.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+2\\geq 2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" /> So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/6/6766091cbc9584fc772eb5f9688d052917c6bd5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{f(x)=0\\qquad \\forall x\\geq2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"170\" height=\"29\" />\n</p><p>Now, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/3/753e40a1d67ac7a50cbac7437631c9530039984e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(2-y,y)\\implies f((2-y)f(y))f(y)=0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"322\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Here, we are working with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/8/0084d6a099e45e3b1ffdc5796a6f686700b7abe1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\leq y&lt;2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" /> Since we may not have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b03d3bcd20efb1a34da217587701b882ff7e50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> due to condition (iii), we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/9/de928c0548c83c9c24468b52f09cb29404beaea4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f((2-y)f(y))=0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>From our first solution, it is imperative that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/4/ae443e5839b33ceaba20f474a873ff55e537ed19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2-y)f(y)\\geq 2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"130\" height=\"20\" /> So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/d/5ad89b115d53ccbf820f6ee22892b8dfc8b577b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y)\\geq \\dfrac{2}{2-y} \\qquad (1).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"163\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Now consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/5/f0522e6e88236a5de446c5ef18e8383bd310a31a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(\\dfrac{2}{f(y),y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"76\" height=\"41\" />. We get,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/8/6087aabbbaa1272235ab346c79f812deb45b7374.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0=f\\left(\\dfrac{2+yf(y)}{f(y)}\\right).\\]\" width=\"159\" height=\"43\" />Similar to the previous step, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/4/054d9a5e091f20d7be0ec4b9df1b12a16ad499f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{2+yf(y)}{f(y)}\\geq 2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"116\" height=\"43\" /> Re arranging this, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/1/8c1af7aa3216ae329259a9412e5187cea3241db7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y)\\leq \\dfrac{2}{2-y}\\qquad (2).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"163\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/d/55d2d6ae8dc42c453e185eb15218630a292c6e60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> satisfies both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edfab0dd6bac5131ab929c8459a0de0c4486dd27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b10d4cf9d7c4111ca34e5dec5cb6163d46f76703.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{f(x)=\\dfrac{2}{2-x}\\qquad \\forall x\\in [0,2)}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"234\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>Of course, we plug both solution back to see if they satisfy the three conditions. Sure enough, they do!\n</p><p>This solution was posted and copyrighted by proshi. The original thread for this problem can be found here: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://aops.com/community/p11129743\">[3]</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_IMO\" title=\"1986 IMO\">1986 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1986 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1986 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1986 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1986 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1986 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1986 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017084350\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.775 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 345/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 895/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 13015/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.326      1 Template:IMO_box\n100.00%    7.326      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8870:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017084350 and revision id 226303. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}